<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/commissions.css">
<link
    rel="stylesheet"
    href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css"
/>
<section class="commission-page">

    <div class="commission-hero">
        <h1>Let's Create Something Special</h1>

        <p>
            Have an idea for something made just for you? KV Artchives accepts
            <br>
            custom commissions, including personalized pet keychains and other
            <br>
            unique handmade clay pieces.
        </p>
    </div>

    <section class="commission-steps">

        <div class="commission-card">
            <div class="step-number">01</div>

            <h2>SHARE YOUR IDEA</h2>

            <p>
                Tell us what you'd like to have made
                and provide any reference photos or
                details.
            </p>
        </div>


        <div class="commission-card">
            <div class="step-number">02</div>

            <h2>SEND US A MESSAGE</h2>

            <p>
                Contact KV Artchives directly through
                Instagram or Facebook.
            </p>
        </div>


        <div class="commission-card">
            <div class="step-number">03</div>

            <h2>DISCUSS THE DETAILS</h2>

            <p>
                We'll talk with you about the design,
                price, materials, timeline, and other
                commission details.
            </p>
        </div>

    </section>

    <section class="commission-contact">

        <div class="message-icon">💌</div>

        <h2>Ready to start?</h2>

        <p>
            Want to request a custom order? Simply send us a message through
            <br>
            Instagram or Facebook. Tell us your idea, preferred design, and any
            <br>
            details you'd like us to know, and we'll discuss the possibilities with you
            <br>
            directly.
        </p>


        <div class="social-buttons">

            <a
                href="https://www.instagram.com/kv_artchives"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
                class="social-button"
            >
                <span class="social-icon instagram-icon">
                    <i class="fa-brands fa-instagram"></i>
                </span>

                Message @kv_artchives on Instagram
            </a>


            <a
                href="https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=61582593320686&mibextid=wwXIfr"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
                class="social-button"
            >
                <span class="social-icon">
                    <i class="fa-brands fa-facebook-f"></i>
                </span>

                Message KV Artchives on Facebook
            </a>
        </div>
    </section>

</section>